{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>עקב.</b> Like לעולם עקב שכר באחרונה (always, reward comes at the end). The meaning of the first verse: the keeper of the covenant — who kept the covenant of Abraham. And you, if you are among those who love Him, He will further keep the covenant. And if you were among those who love Him, [then] ואהבך וברכך והרבך (and He will love you and bless you and multiply you) — this is the meaning of the covenant and the kindness."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 7, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:22:42.593967964Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}